@extends('layouts.app')

@section('title')
  Control flow
@endsection

@section('content')
  <h1>Control flow</h1>
  <p>Control flow decides what a view renders. It uses the same directives as Blade: <code>@@if</code>, <code>@@foreach</code> and <code>@@forelse</code>, each closed by its own end directive.</p>

  <h2><code>@@if</code>, <code>@@elseif</code> and <code>@@else</code></h2>
  <p>The first true branch renders, and the rest are skipped. The condition is a field of the context. A value is false when it is <code>null</code>, <code>false</code>, zero, an empty string, or an empty list or object.</p>
<pre><code class="language-blade">@@if ($is_admin)
  &lt;p&gt;Admin&lt;/p&gt;
@@elseif ($is_member)
  &lt;p&gt;Member&lt;/p&gt;
@@else
  &lt;p&gt;Guest&lt;/p&gt;
@@endif</code></pre>
  <h3>Live example</h3>
  @if ($is_admin)
    <p>Admin</p>
  @elseif ($is_member)
    <p>Member</p>
  @else
    <p>Guest</p>
  @endif

  <h2><code>@@foreach</code></h2>
  <p>Repeats the body for each item. Inside the loop, the loop variable (here <code>tag</code>) holds the current item.</p>
<pre><code class="language-blade">@@foreach (tag in tags)
  &lt;li&gt;@{{ $tag }}&lt;/li&gt;
@@endforeach</code></pre>
  <h3>Live example</h3>
  <ul>
    @foreach (tag in tags)
      <li>{{ $tag }}</li>
    @endforeach
  </ul>

  <h2><code>@@forelse</code> and <code>@@empty</code></h2>
  <p>Like <code>@@foreach</code>, but it renders the <code>@@empty</code> branch when the list has no items. A <code>null</code> list counts as empty.</p>
<pre><code class="language-blade">@@forelse (item in items)
  &lt;li&gt;@{{ $item }}&lt;/li&gt;
@@empty
  &lt;li&gt;Nothing here yet.&lt;/li&gt;
@@endforelse</code></pre>
  <h3>Live example, with an empty list</h3>
  <ul>
    @forelse (item in empty_items)
      <li>{{ $item }}</li>
    @empty
      <li>Nothing here yet.</li>
    @endforelse
  </ul>

  <h2>Optional values</h2>
  <p>A nested field of a <code>null</code> value prints nothing, so an optional relation can be used without a check.</p>
<pre><code class="language-blade">&lt;p&gt;Author: @{{ $author.name }}&lt;/p&gt;</code></pre>
  <h3>Live example, with no author</h3>
  <p>Author: [{{ $author.name }}]</p>
@endsection
